diff --git a/changelog/7220.bugfix.rst b/changelog/7220.bugfix.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..7e31638
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/7220.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Fixed the path shown for a test file in the traceback when the current working
+directory is changed during a test (for example by a fixture): the path is now
+kept relative to the directory where pytest was invoked instead of the changed
+working directory.
